.skills-bank/
# Per-skill app-state sidecars.
#
# `.skills-bank.json` carries the per-skill upstream pointer + source
# axis. Under the origin-paradigm-reframe plan, the bundled repo
# commits these so end users inherit the correct upstream values via
# the .dmg — they are NOT gitignored here. Other registries (user's
# linkedRepo with their own skills) may choose to either commit or
# ignore based on whether they want their .skills-bank-as-curation
# behavior. The bundled-repo convention is: commit.
#
# `.skills-bank-hash` stays gitignored. It's pure drift-detection
# state — the hash of local content at last known-clean state, which
# the desktop app regenerates on demand. Shipping it with .dmg would
# bake in a baseline that's computed at build time and might not
# match the user's installed bytes exactly (line endings, file modes).
.skills-bank-hash
# `.skills-bank-runtime.json` is the v0.11.7 runtime sidecar for
# `fetchedAt` (and any future per-skill runtime field — ADR-0002).
# Same reasoning: probe-time state that mutates on every app launch
# and has no business in the committed marker set.
.skills-bank-runtime.json
.claude/settings.local.json
